 when ''2'' then ''View exclude these fields - ''||view_flds 	
 when ''4'' then ''No access'' else ''All'' end viewdlts, 
 case b.editctrl when ''0'' then ''All'' 
 when ''1'' then ''Edit these fields - ''||edit_flds 
